        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>INOX GD110B, Stainless Steel 2-1/16 Inch Round Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWhile the GD Series deadbolt requires a custom door preparation, its smaller size adds to the modern appeal. The Sleek and Small Single Cylinder Deadbolt looks great on new builds because its smaller footprint looks so modern, especially when paired with one of INOX's matching <a href=\"/collections/inox-leversets\">Stainless Steel Leversets</a>. The Stainless Steel 2-1/16 Inch Round Single Cylinder Deadbolt is available in polished stainless steel, satin stainless steel, and oil rubbed bronze stainless steel finishes. A single cylinder deadbolt, it is locked and unlocked by a key from the outside and a thumbturn on the inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Round Single Cylinder Stainless Steel Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C, 5-pin</li>\r\n<li>Concealed M5 thru-bolt installation.</li>\r\n<li>For residential or light-duty commercial applications.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the INOX GD110B 2-1/16\" Diameter Stainless Steel Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Cast Stainless Steel Outside Escutcheon and Wrought Stainless Steel Inside Escutcheon.</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 19/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Rose Projection: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumbturn Width: 23/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt\" 1\" throw</i>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/INX-GD110B-specifications.pdf?v=1704262377\"><b>INOX GD110B Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Not for use on 2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/INX-Finish-3.jpg?v=1704354524\" width=\"600\" height=\"121\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Inox Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
