                "title": "Sleek and Small Single Cylinder Deadbolt",
                "description": "While the GD Series deadbolt requires a custom door preparation, its smaller size adds to the modern appeal. The Sleek and Small Single Cylinder Deadbolt looks great on new builds because its smaller footprint looks so modern, especially when paired with one of INOX's matching Stainless Steel Leversets. The Stainless Steel 2-1/16 Inch Round Single Cylinder Deadbolt is available in polished stainless steel, satin stainless steel, and oil rubbed bronze stainless steel finishes. A single cylinder deadbolt, it is locked and unlocked by a key from the outside and a thumbturn on the inside.\r\n\r\n",
